From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Modrinth Enhanced <patches@modrinth-enhanced.invalid>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 10:17:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Use the Modrinth Enhanced icon

Replaces the bundled application icons with the Modrinth mark on its dark
disc plus a sparkle badge marking the build as the enhanced fork.

The badge carries a dark outline that follows its own shape rather than
sitting in a punched-out circle, so the mark's ring stays continuous
behind it, and a soft glow underneath makes it read as lit rather than
pasted on. The disc itself gets a slight radial falloff for depth.

The vector source the whole set is rendered from is checked in next to
the generated files as `modrinth-enhanced.svg`; scripts/render-icons.py
regenerates them from it.

`icons/apple.icon` is left untouched: it is an Icon Composer source that
nothing in the build references.
